
-- Context Demo - Learn Moringa's Context Switching
-- Contexts provide scoped conversation modes
-- Try: "enter work", "hello", "enter play", "hello", "exit"

-- Global context switchers
Recognizer "enter work"
	Enter "work"
	Remember "User entered work context"
	Option Say "Entering work mode. Time to be productive!"

Recognizer "enter play"
	Enter "play"
	Remember "User entered play context"
	Option Say "Entering play mode. Let's have fun!"

-- Global greeting (works in any context)
Recognizer "hello"
	Remember "User said hello"
	Option Say "Hello! Try 'enter work' or 'enter play' to see context switching."

